  "Services switch on service jobs, maintenance contracts, equipment and service reports (and projects and timesheets for service companies and Enterprise level).": "Huduma zinawasha kazi za huduma, mikataba ya matengenezo, vifaa na ripoti za huduma (na miradi na rejista za saa kwa kampuni za huduma na kiwango cha Enterprise).",
  "Switch any single feature on or off below; nothing is deleted.": "Washa au zima kipengele kimoja chini; hakuna kinachofutwa.",
  "Services & prices from LeMo Tech": "Huduma na bei kutoka LeMo Tech",
