  "Open Services & prices and choose TZS or USD.": "Fungua Huduma na bei na uchague TZS au USD.",
  "Press Request on what you need and add a note. Playbooks can be requested by anyone; paid services by management or finance.": "Bonyeza Omba kwenye unachohitaji na uongeze maelezo. Miongozo inaweza kuombwa na mtu yeyote; huduma za kulipia na uongozi au fedha.",
  "LeMo Tech approves the request; add-ons switch on at once and the cost comes on your next LeMoSp invoice.": "LeMo Tech inaidhinisha ombi; nyongeza zinawashwa mara moja na gharama inakuja kwenye ankara yako ijayo ya LeMoSp.",
  "Your LeMoSp plan, what the next bill will be, invoices from LeMo Tech and how to pay.": "Mpango wako wa LeMoSp, bili ijayo itakuwa kiasi gani, ankara kutoka LeMo Tech na jinsi ya kulipa.",
